  "extract_html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"ib-wrap\" style=\"width:400px\">\n   \n<aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-midnightblue pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"Box title\">Crystal Conversion</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/0/0f/I_spy_fuel_crystals.gif/revision/latest?cb=20211023003601\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"I spy fuel crystals\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/0/0f/I_spy_fuel_crystals.gif/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/515?cb=20211023003601\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/0/0f/I_spy_fuel_crystals.gif/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/515?cb=20211023003601 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/0/0f/I_spy_fuel_crystals.gif/revision/latest?cb=20211023003601 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"I spy fuel crystals\" width=\"270\" height=\"152\" data-image-key=\"I_spy_fuel_crystals.gif\" data-image-name=\"I spy fuel crystals.gif\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">The Rocket Ship (I Spy: Fantasy) converts a fuel crystal into energy.</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Row 1 info\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Power/Ability to:</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Transform crystals into matter or energy.</div>\n</div>\n</aside>\n</div>\n<p>The power to <b>convert crystals into other forms of matter or energy.</b> Technique of <a href=\"/wiki/Crystal_Manipulation\" title=\"Crystal Manipulation\">Crystal Manipulation</a>.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\